##Note=These four ##META lines are copied verbatim from VCFv4.3.tex:273-276, including its Type-before-Number attribute order, which is out of BaseMetadata's canonical ID,Number,Type,... order but is deliberately NOT attribute-order checked (see MetaMetadata's Javadoc and VCF_SPEC_AMBIGUITIES.md's "##META attribute order" entry): no spec version requires an order, and bcftools 1.23.1 accepts this exact ordering silently; only vcf_validator 0.10.2 rejects it ("Error in META metadata"), and it is not credible here because it also rejects the spec's own worked example.
